a":"وَمَآ","t":"and not","p":"NEG","tr":"wamā","l":2,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["مَآ","NEG","stem",""]]},{"i":"10:53:10","a":"أَنتُم","t":"you","p":"PRON","tr":"antum","f":["2MP"],"l":85},{"i":"10:53:11","a":"بِمُعْجِزِينَ","t":"(can) escape (it)","p":"N","tr":"bimuʿ'jizīna","f":["ACT","PCPL","(IV)","MP","GEN"],"r":337,"l":734,"g":[["بِ","P","prefix","bi"],["مُعْجِزِينَ","N","stem","ACT|PCPL|(IV)|MP|GEN"]]},{"e":"٥٣","v":"10:53"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"10:43","t":"And among them are those who look at you. But can you guide the blind although they will not [attempt to] see?","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"10:44","t":"Indeed, Allāh does not wrong the people at all, but it is the people who are wronging themselves.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"10:45","t":"And on the Day when He will gather them, [it will be] as if they had not remained [in the world] but an hour of the day, [and] they will know each other. Those will have lost who denied the meeting with Allāh and were not guided.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"10:46","t":"And whether We show you some of what We promise them, [O Muḥammad], or We take you in death, to Us is their return; then, [either way], Allāh is a witness concerning what they are doing.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"10:47","t":"And for every nation is a messenger. So when their messenger comes, it will be judged between them in justice, and they will not be wronged.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"10:48","t":"And they say, \"When is [the fulfillment of] this promise, if you should be truthful?\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"10:49","t":"Say, \"I possess not for myself any harm or benefit except what Allāh should will. For every nation is a [specified] term. When their time has come, then they will not remain behind an hour, nor will they precede [it].\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"10:50","t":"Say, \"Have you considered: if His punishment should come to you by night or by day - for which [aspect] of it would the criminals be impatient?\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"10:51","t":"Then is it that when it has [actually] occurred you will believe in it? Now? And you were [once] for it impatient.","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"10:52","t":"Then it will be said to those who had wronged, \"Taste the punishment of eternity; are you being recompensed except for what you used to earn?\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"10:53","t":"And they ask information of you, [O Muḥammad], \"Is it true?\" Say, \"Yes, by my Lord. Indeed, it is truth; and you will not cause failure [to Allāh].\"","j":11,"h":22,"s":10,"a":53,"sd":null}],"juz":11,"hizb":22,"surahs":[10],"sajdah":false}